"alt":null,"lat":32.78358,"lng":35.542568,"price":"₪90","priceClass":"budget","hours":null,"url":null,"phone":"+972 4-672-0007","address":"Hagalil Street 66","content":"Very poor hostel, many complaints on various websites. You will not want to stay here, but just in case Tiberias Hostel is full.","wikidata":null},{"type":"sleep","name":"David Hostel","alt":null,"lat":32.794972,"lng":35.531096,"price":"₪240","priceClass":"mid","hours":null,"url":"https://www.davidhostel.com/","phone":"+972 54-447-1022","address":"Rachel Street","content":"Not really a hostel. A homely atmosphere, the hostel includes 10 rooms, each one with a bathroom, shower, TV & air conditioner. There are also 2 guest kitchens, a large lounge, a balcony, WiFi & laundry service. In addition, David, the owner, will happily offer you guidance and suggestions for tours in the area over a steaming cup of herbal tea or a cool glass of water. The neighborhood is quiet and peaceful.","wikidata":null},{"type":"sleep","name":"Golan Hotel Tiberias","alt":null,"lat":32.79879,"lng":35.53121,"price":null,"priceClass":"mid","hours":null,"url":"https://www.golanhotel.com/","phone":"+972 4-6711555","address":"Ahad Ha'am 61","content":null,"wikidata":null},{"type":"sleep","name":"Emilys & Aviv Hotels","alt":"Emilys & Aviv Hotels Tiberias","lat":32.7835,"lng":35.5425,"price":null,"priceClass":"mid","hours":null,"url":"https://english.emilys-aviv.co.il/","phone":"+972 46647500","address":"Sderot Eliezer Kaplan 1, Tiberias","content":"The rich stories of our hotels began a few decades ago, and is intertwined in the story of Tiberias. Our hotels are the realization of the vision of one very special woman, Emily. whose biggest wish was to bring as many people from around the world as possible to the shores of her lovable Kinneret (The Sea Of Galilee), and make them feel at home, while enjoying the famous Tiberian hospitality.Emily, the founding moth","wikidata":null},{"type":"sleep","name":"Kinar Galilee Hotel","alt":nu